parseIPv4Fields and parseIPv6, Copyright 2009 The Go Authors, BSD-3-Clause
(LICENSE-GO). Source is retained under references/go-stdlib-1.26.0. Unicode
printability uses the existing fixed Go strconv table in sip/domain/go_print.rs.

Only child messages actually cloned by the source evaluator carry their own
unknown-field provenance into the different response type. Catalog/root unknowns
are not copied across types. Media Merge starts from the rule media clone and
explicitly inherits trunk codec/time-limit child provenance when source rules do.
